---
title: Beaufort cipher
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/tool-frame.njk" import toolFrame %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    Similar to the Vigenère cipher (the decryption process is the same), except you start with a reversed alphabet. For example: <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Hello</code> encrypted with a key of <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Test</code> would shift like: 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        H &srarr; T &srarr; M
    </code> 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        e &srarr; e &srarr; a
    </code>
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        l &srarr; s &srarr; h
    </code> 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        l &srarr; t &srarr; i
    </code>
    - then loop back and start from the first letter in the key again. There is more information available on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaufort_cipher" class="text-convrtr">Beaufort cipher</a> Wikipedia page. 
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
{% call toolFrame(filename, "Beaufort cipher", placeholder = "Example: Hello &srarr; Test [key] &srarr; Mahif") %}
<div class="input-group w-auto">
    <label class="input-group-text" for="{{ filename }}Key"><span class="visually-hidden">Beaufort </span>Key</label>
    <input type="text" class="form-control" id="{{ filename }}Key" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="{{ filename }}Status">
    <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Encrypt" aria-pressed="true">Encrypt</button>
    <button class="btn btn-outline-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Decrypt" aria-pressed="false">Decrypt</button>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endcall %}
